  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scenarios Analysis for Implementing the European Green Deal and Green Recovery in Hungary</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assessing co-benefits of green deal scenarios (modelled with GEM) to determine the potential contributions to reducing biodiversity loss and social inequality (using simulation tools). These co-benefits are added social, economic, or environmental benefits above and beyond direct benefits of reducing GHG emissions and the economic indicators already covered in the analysis performed with GEM.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will measure potential co-benefits on ecosystem health and inclusive growth of low-carbon scenarios under the European Green Deal.</narrative>
  </description>
